    "article_summary": "The article describes an NHC/photoredox dual catalytic strategy for the Suzuki-type cross-coupling of alkyl trifluoroborates with acid fluorides. This method enables the synthesis of various ketones under mild conditions, bypassing the sluggish transmetalation step typical of C(sp3) boron reagents through a radical-mediated mechanism involving energy transfer and single-electron transfer.",
